# TESTING-HARNESS.md §2 — a daemon mutation remains busy until its UI mirror has applied it.
#
# The fixture context owns repositories. Creating and selecting an empty second context mutates
# daemon state; the assertion after the bare `await idle` must therefore see the new snapshot.
fixture: busy
await idle 30000
assert lists.repos.rows[1].label == "acme/api" && lists.worktrees.rows[3] exists

key N
await overlay == Dialog 10000
type Settlement
key enter
await idle 30000
assert overlay absent && lists.repos.rows[1].label == "acme/api"

key 2
await idle 30000
assert lists.repos.rows[1] absent && lists.worktrees.rows[0] absent && overlay absent
quit
